2. **`new Set(arr)`:** This creates a `Set` object. When you pass an array to the `Set` constructor, it iterates over the array and adds each element. If an element already exists in the `Set`, it is ignored.
3. **`[... ]` (Spread Syntax):** This takes the unique values stored in the `Set` and spreads them back out into a new array.

